WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:04.912
To keep your entries in one place, add the tracker to your home screen.

00:05.800 --> 00:08.560
Tap Share at the bottom of Safari.

00:09.300 --> 00:11.988
Then tap Add to Home Screen.

00:12.800 --> 00:14.360
Tap Add.

00:15.300 --> 00:18.852
Now open the tracker from its home-screen icon.

00:19.300 --> 00:21.652
And your entries are right there.
